WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.134 --> 00:00:10.677
Mom, we have to go now.

00:00:10.761 --> 00:00:12.137
Give me three more minutes.

00:00:12.221 --> 00:00:13.305
Go eat something.

00:00:13.889 --> 00:00:16.642
I'm going to say yes
to everyone who asks me out

00:00:16.725 --> 00:00:17.935
for the next 30 days.

00:00:18.018 --> 00:00:19.144
How does that work?

00:00:19.228 --> 00:00:20.521
On an app or something,

00:00:20.604 --> 00:00:23.190
or walking down the street
and somebody asks me out.

00:00:23.273 --> 00:00:24.358
When does that happen?

00:00:24.691 --> 00:00:26.068
I don't know
when women flirt.

00:00:26.151 --> 00:00:27.903
-Are you a bad boy?
-I'm a bad boy.

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:30.113
I'd assume
you've been flirting with me,

00:00:30.197 --> 00:00:31.448
but you'd say what? "No"?

00:00:31.532 --> 00:00:33.283
Well, of course
I'm gonna say no.

00:00:33.367 --> 00:00:35.035
All right.&nbsp;That's the point.

00:00:35.577 --> 00:00:36.954
How about you,
is there anyone?

00:00:37.037 --> 00:00:39.122
Yeah. There's a lady.
Her name is Tinder.

00:00:39.414 --> 00:00:40.249
She's great.

00:00:40.332 --> 00:00:41.875
She has many different faces.

00:00:42.376 --> 00:00:44.628
I ended up telling Brian
that we were open.

00:00:44.711 --> 00:00:47.130
Really? You told him
just 'cause it came up,

00:00:47.214 --> 00:00:48.257
or you told him 'cause

00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:49.383
you're hoping
some other stuff

00:00:49.466 --> 00:00:50.509
will come up?

00:00:51.426 --> 00:00:52.719
Ever heard that phrase,

00:00:52.803 --> 00:00:54.680
"The best way
to get over one man

00:00:54.763 --> 00:00:56.181
is to get under another"?

00:00:56.807 --> 00:00:58.725
Every time I think
I have it figured out,

00:00:58.809 --> 00:01:00.102
something like this happens.

00:01:00.435 --> 00:01:04.231
I want to try other things
and have more experiences

00:01:04.314 --> 00:01:07.693
before I just end up
in a relationship forever.

00:01:07.776 --> 00:01:09.069
Hey, I'm proud of you.

00:01:09.152 --> 00:01:10.696
-For real?
-Yeah. Let's go.

00:01:13.407 --> 00:01:15.867
You are smart, and bright,
and exceptional.

00:01:15.951 --> 00:01:17.327
And funny and gorgeous.

00:01:17.411 --> 00:01:18.745
Funny and stunning.

00:01:21.498 --> 00:01:23.458
I just feel like
you've gotta reach.

00:01:23.542 --> 00:01:25.877
God, I'm just filled
with self-help BS.

00:01:25.961 --> 00:01:27.254
It's working.

00:01:27.337 --> 00:01:28.714
It's like a video game.

00:01:28.797 --> 00:01:31.174
It is, but it's fun in that way.
Like, you could win.

